# Smoke-test screenshots are regenerated on every run; the icon is a real asset.
build/smoke*.png

# A calibration is something a machine earned by running the backtest, not
# something the app arrives already believing. A committed one would hand the
# next person a measurement they never made — on a universe chosen by somebody
# who already knew how it turned out — and switch off the "Uncalibrated: this is
# a ranking, not a probability" banner the whole honesty story rests on.
# Diagnostics from `npm run share` are copied into data/reports/ instead, where
# nothing reads them.
data/calibration.json
data/calibration-*.json
